## Next Steps for Deployment
To complete the Analytics setup:
1. Enable Web Analytics in your Vercel project dashboard (Analytics tab)
2. Deploy the application to Vercel using `vercel deploy` or Git integration
3. After deployment, verify tracking by checking the Network tab for analytics requests
4. View analytics data in the Vercel dashboard (data appears within a few days)

